00:22:10,062 --> 00:22:14,372
First, Langchain excels at chaining multiple language models together.

227
00:22:14,990 --> 00:22:21,156
This means you can connect different models in a sequence to create sophisticated multi-step workflows.

228
00:22:21,550 --> 00:22:30,500
Instead of forcing one model to do everything, you can use GPT-4 for complex reasoning, a smaller model for simple classifications,

229
00:22:30,862 --> 00:22:37,028
