351
00:34:28,526 --> 00:34:34,532
Langchain also integrates seamlessly with open source models like Llama, Mistral, and others.

352
00:34:35,182 --> 00:34:40,804
This allows you to experiment and build production systems without relying on paid model providers.

353
00:34:41,614 --> 00:34:51,332
The free ecosystem is perfect for developers learning Gen AI, students, small teams, and anyone wanting full control without vendor lock-in.

354
00:34:52,014 --> 00:34:55,872
You manage deployment, infrastructure, and architecture decisions.

355
00:34:56,110 --> 00:35:04,452
