00:41:25,646 --> 00:41:28,996
This key authorizes access to Open Router services.

415
00:41:30,190 --> 00:41:42,372
Following this, we test the authentication by sending a direct HTTP request to OpenRouter, ensuring the API key works correctly before proceeding with Langchain integration.

416
00:41:43,150 --> 00:41:49,828
The header section passes the authorization header with the API key and specifies the content type.

417
00:41:50,382 --> 00:41:54,692
The payload contains the actual test message to send to the API.

418
00:41:55,310 --> 00:42:01,380
We use request post function to send the POST request with the URL, headers, and payload.

419
00:42:01,998 --> 00:42:06,052
