01:03:12,590 --> 01:03:20,580
The goal of this project is to create an intelligent system that reads a PDF document, cleans and understands its content,

637
01:03:21,038 --> 01:03:26,468
summarizes key ideas, and answers user questions directly from the document text.

638
01:03:27,054 --> 01:03:32,388
This project focuses on clarity, reliability, and real-world usability.

639
01:03:32,750 --> 01:03:42,240
Instead of complex frameworks, we rely on simple, transparent steps so learners clearly understand how document intelligence systems work end-to-end.

640
01:03:42,798 --> 01:03:44,388
Let's look at the problem statement.

641
01:03:44,974 --> 01:03:53,040
Document and professionals work with large numbers of PDF documents, such as reports, policies, research papers,

642
01:03:53,280 --> 01:03:54,052
and manuals.

643
01:03:54,766 --> 01:04:01,840
Manually reading these documents to extract insights or answer questions is time-consuming and inefficient.

644
01:04:02,000 --> 01:04:10,720
The challenge is to build a system that reads PDF documents automatically, understands their content, summarizes important

645
01:04:11,040 --> 01:04:16,740
information, and answers user questions accurately using only the document text.

646
01:04:17,710 --> 01:04:24,164
This mini project solves the problem by turning a static PDF into an interactive knowledge source.

647
01:04:24,910 --> 01:04:30,480
So, we are building a system that answers questions like what is this document about?

648
01:04:30,958 --> 01:04:32,260
What are the key ideas?

649
01:04:32,814 --> 01:04:35,748
How does the document define a specific concept?

650
01:04:36,526 --> 01:04:39,556
All answers are grounded in the PDF content.

651
01:04:40,014 --> 01:04:42,276
No external knowledge is injected.

652
01:04:42,862 --> 01:04:47,520
The key objective includes, first, PDF text extraction.

653
01:04:47,790 --> 01:04:52,068
This ensures the system works on real business and academic PDFs.

654
01:04:52,622 --> 01:04:55,360
Next, text cleaning and normalization.

655
01:04:55,886 --> 01:05:00,100
