1404
02:11:32,238 --> 02:11:34,724
This is where Canvas earns its real value.

1405
02:11:35,182 --> 02:11:39,108
You can engage with your document at multiple levels simultaneously.

1406
02:11:39,566 --> 02:11:41,828
Canvas is refined at every level.

1407
