1702
02:38:16,430 --> 02:38:17,828
Next is agent mode.

1703
02:38:18,190 --> 02:38:20,068
What is it and why does it matter?

1704
02:38:20,622 --> 02:38:25,156
So far, everything we have talked about in this session has followed the same pattern.

1705
02:38:25,550 --> 02:38:29,860
You ask Chat GPT, you ask, and then ChatGPT answers.

1706
02:38:30,318 --> 02:38:34,564
You guide every step, it responds to each input, and waits for the next.

1707
02:38:35,406 --> 02:38:39,844
That's a powerful workflow, but it still puts the burden of planning on you.

1708
02:38:40,590 --> 02:38:44,868
You have to know what question to ask in what order to get to the outcome you want.

1709
02:38:45,998 --> 02:38:47,940
Agent Mode flips that entirely.

1710
02:38:48,622 --> 02:38:57,572
Instead of answering your question step by step, agent mode allows you to give Chat GPT a goal and then watches it figure out the steps on its own.

1711
02:38:58,542 --> 02:39:00,836
Here's a concrete example to make this real.

1712
02:39:01,390 --> 02:39:05,604
Without agent mode, you ask, what are some good budget smartphones?

1713
02:39:06,542 --> 02:39:07,460
It gives you a list.

1714
02:39:08,270 --> 02:39:12,260
Then you ask, compare the top three on battery life and camera.

1715
02:39:13,070 --> 02:39:14,052
It compares them.

1716
02:39:14,766 --> 02:39:17,124
Then you ask, now put it in a table.

1717
02:39:17,486 --> 02:39:20,516
It formats a table, three separate exchanges.

1718
02:39:20,878 --> 02:39:22,660
You managed every transaction.

1719
02:39:23,054 --> 02:39:28,004
With agent mode, you just say, find me three budget smartphones under dollars whatever.

1720
02:39:28,494 --> 02:39:37,540
Compare their key features, battery, camera, storage, and build quality, and give me a summary table I can use to make a decision.

1721
02:39:38,286 --> 02:39:46,148
The agent interprets the goal, breaks it into subtasks, researches current options, compares them, formats the output,

1722
02:39:46,414 --> 02:39:48,996
and delivers everything in one structured response.

1723
02:39:49,774 --> 02:39:52,964
You define the destination, the agent figured out the route.

1724
02:39:53,326 --> 02:39:56,260
This is why the best way to think about agent mode is this.

1725
02:39:56,782 --> 02:40:02,212
It upgrades Chat GPT from an answering machine into a junior analyst who can handle a brief.

1726
02:40:02,862 --> 02:40:04,452
How to use it step by step.

1727
02:40:05,262 --> 02:40:07,300
Step one is enable agent mode.

1728
02:40:07,726 --> 02:40:11,364
Go to settings in the beta features and turn on agent mode.

1729
02:40:11,982 --> 02:40:15,044
It may not be visible in your interface until it's enabled.

1730
02:40:15,886 --> 02:40:16,480
Step two,

1731
02:40:17,230 --> 02:40:19,236
give it a goal, not a question.

1732
02:40:19,950 --> 02:40:23,360
This is the most important mindset shift when using agent

1733
02:40:23,360 --> 02:40:26,080
mode. A question asks for information.

1734
02:40:26,542 --> 02:40:28,228
What laptops are good for students?

1735
02:40:28,974 --> 02:40:30,468
A goal defines an output.

1736
02:40:30,894 --> 02:40:34,980
Research the top five laptops for university students under so and so.

1737
02:40:35,310 --> 02:40:44,260
Compare them on performance, like battery life, weight, and price, and present the findings as a comparison table with a recommendation at the end.

1738
02:40:45,038 --> 02:40:49,508
The richer and clearer your goal, the more useful the agent's output will be.

1739
02:40:50,542 --> 02:40:52,420
Step three, watch it work.

1740
02:40:53,326 --> 02:40:59,716
You will often be able to see agent mode working through its processes, searching, organizing, structuring.

1741
02:41:00,430 --> 02:41:09,700
This transparency helps you follow along, understanding what it's doing, and it also gives you a chance to course correct if it starts heading in a direction you didn't intend.

1742
02:41:10,574 --> 02:41:13,700
Step four, review and redirect if needed.

1743
02:41:14,190 --> 02:41:16,836
Agent mode is powerful but not infallible.

1744
02:41:17,358 --> 02:41:18,916
Review the output critically.

1745
02:41:19,758 --> 02:41:27,076
If something is off, a wrong assumption, a missing dimension, an input format that doesn't suit your needs, you can redirect.

1746
02:41:27,758 --> 02:41:34,468
Redo the comparison but include user review scores from recent sources, or restructure the table to show price first.

1747
02:41:36,142 --> 02:41:37,252
What to keep in mind?

1748
02:41:37,550 --> 02:41:39,556
Available on Plus and Enterprise.

1749
02:41:40,334 --> 02:41:42,564
Agent Mode is not part of Free Tier.

1750
02:41:43,246 --> 02:41:49,700
More advanced actions such as executing tasks across connected apps may require enterprise access.

1751
02:41:50,542 --> 02:41:53,668
Works best with Internet-enabled features active.

1752
02:41:54,510 --> 02:42:02,244
Because Agent Mode often needs to search and gather current information, it performs best when web access is turned on alongside it.

1753
02:42:03,214 --> 02:42:06,020
Agent Mode is not a set it and forget it system.

1754
02:42:06,510 --> 02:42:14,788
It handles complexity well, but it still benefits from clear goals, occasional check-ins, and human review of its final output.

1755
02:42:15,630 --> 02:42:19,812
Think of it as a highly capable assistant, not a replacement for judgment.

1756
02:42:20,846 --> 02:42:22,244
Real-world integration.

1757
02:42:22,638 --> 02:42:24,004
It's not fully autonomous.

1758
02:42:25,006 --> 02:42:27,524
Agent mode is not a set it and forget it system.

1759
02:42:28,366 --> 02:42:36,644
It handles complexity well, but it still benefits from clear goals, occasional check-ins, and human review of its final output.

1760
02:42:37,518 --> 02:42:41,764
Think of it as a highly capable assistant, not a replacement for judgment.

1761
02:42:43,086 --> 02:42:45,732
Real-world application integrations vary.

1762
02:42:46,286 --> 02:42:54,724
The ability to take actions across external apps like booking, sending, filling depends on your and what integrations are available.

1763
02:42:55,598 --> 02:43:03,748
For most users, Agent Mode's strength today is in research analysis and structured output, not yet in full cross-platform execution.

1764
02:43:04,558 --> 02:43:08,420
Let's zoom out and look at what these three tools actually represent together.

1765
02:43:10,030 --> 02:43:18,416
Deep research gives you the intelligence of a well-read research analyst, one who goes beyond a single source, finds current information,

1766
02:43:18,734 --> 02:43:21,380
