1767
02:43:22,222 --> 02:43:32,292
Create image gives you the creative output of a visual designer, one who can turn a description into a polished visual in seconds without requiring any design skills from you.

1768
02:43:33,422 --> 02:43:41,988
Agent Mode gives you the problem-solving capacity of a junior analyst, one who can take a goal, plan the approach, do the legwork,

1769
02:43:42,318 --> 02:43:44,004
and deliver a structured result.

1770
02:43:45,102 --> 02:43:50,148
Individually, each of these is a significant upgrade over standard Chat GPT.

1771
02:43:50,766 --> 02:43:58,736
Together, they represent a fundamentally different kind of tool, one that doesn't just respond to you, but actively helps you think, create,

1772
02:43:58,958 --> 02:43:59,620
