1773
02:44:00,494 --> 02:44:04,836
The most important shift in all of this is not technical, it's mental.

1774
02:44:05,550 --> 02:44:12,100
The users who get the most out of these tools are the ones who stop asking simple questions and start giving clear goals.

1775
02:44:12,590 --> 02:44:19,652
The ones who stop treating ChatGPT as a search engine and start treating it as a capable, its imperfect working partner.

1776
02:44:20,142 --> 02:44:22,340
That's the skill this session is building toward.

1777
02:44:22,990 --> 02:44:32,676
And the more fluent you become in how to use these tools, when to reach for deep search versus a standard reply, how to write prompts that unlock great images,

1778
02:44:33,134 --> 02:44:39,908
