Highlight the winning combination.

3411
04:57:27,566 --> 04:57:32,388
Display a status message telling that whose turn is it and how to go about it.

3412
04:57:32,910 --> 04:57:35,236
A restart button to reset this game.

3413
04:57:35,854 --> 04:57:40,132
Clean centered UI with hover over effects on empty cells.

3414
04:57:40,752 --> 04:57:43,108
No external libraries or frameworks.

3415
04:57:43,854 --> 04:57:47,524
So this is my simple prompt that I'm giving it to my Claude code.

3416
04:57:47,854 --> 04:57:51,492
Now you have to select your local folders before giving anything.

3417
04:57:51,950 --> 04:57:55,588
So this is my simple folder that is Stat GPT Courses.

3418
04:57:56,270 --> 04:57:59,268
So this is this folder that I have selected by default.

3419
04:57:59,694 --> 04:58:02,116
So here everything goes and gets settled.

3420
04:58:02,766 --> 04:58:04,004
So this is my prompt.

3421
04:58:04,334 --> 04:58:05,636
Now let me execute it.

3422
04:58:06,158 --> 04:58:09,092
In seconds you will get the output from Claude Code.

3423
04:58:09,550 --> 04:58:10,660
