4097
05:54:12,526 --> 05:54:14,064
The square version works for post.

4098
05:54:14,638 --> 05:54:16,932
The tall one feels perfect for stories.

4099
05:54:17,230 --> 05:54:22,308
The wide one fits YouTube thumbnails, and the extra wide one looks like a clean web banner.

4100
05:54:22,638 --> 05:54:28,836
So everything shares the same bottle, color palette, and background mood, so it still looks like one campaign.

4101
05:54:29,230 --> 05:54:34,084
Once we are happy with the visuals, we just have to download it and organize them as per our needs.

4102
